<title>UK: BNG adds 1.0 bln rand to Dec 2017 Zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>BNG adds 1.0 bln rand to Dec 2017 Zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 3.5 billion rand from 2.5 billion rand, lead manager Toronto Dominion said.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> MT    2.5 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    29.DEC.17</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  6.75	PAY DATE    29.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    6.50	SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  25 BP</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   LISTING    LUX/AMST SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
